config LEDS_A9_FRONTLIGHT
	tristate "Hisense A9 AW99703/KTD3137 frontlight LEDs"
	depends on I2C && OF && GPIOLIB
	depends on LEDS_CLASS
	help
	  Four raw 11-bit frontlight LEDs using the Hisense A9 stock electrical
	  profiles. Per-chip brightness gains belong in userspace, not here.
	  If built as a module it is named a9-frontlight.
